  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local structures are established/strengthened and engaged in improving market access and incomes through the establishment and training of savings and credit groups, cooperatives, other groups promoting value chain development of climate resilient food production (market gardening, poultry farming, small livestock and other production). The access to internal credit and credit from financial institutions will be facilitated  for members of cooperatives. Cooperatives and other groups will draw up simplified business plans in order to start small enterprises. Focus is given to those in most vulnerable situations, such as women headed households, pregnant, lactating and women of childbearing age, children and youth, and people living with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
